        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Become the master of parkour</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced, parkour-flavored extreme sports game. Your goal is simple - make tons of spectacular tricks and stunts. Chain backflips, front flips, and gainers using dynamic ragdoll physics. Explore levels freely, trigger slo-mo, and relive your best moves with the replay feature.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The long-awaited sequel has finally arrived! Backflip Madness 2 brings more thrills with enhanced graphics, realistic physics, smooth animations, and new features like fully explorable levels, character customization, and combo tricks. Dive into the ultimate parkour experience.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic physics-based gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Parkour / Freerunning acrobatics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully explorable levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ragdoll physics and simulation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple backflips, front flips, and gainers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combo chaining</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slo-mo and Lunar Gravity</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character customization</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Complete game objectives</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613530/extras/e44a95d24b14756963d7c63c8c67e223.poster.avif?t=1774462319\" width=1170 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613530/extras/e44a95d24b14756963d7c63c8c67e223.webm?t=1774462319\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613530/extras/e44a95d24b14756963d7c63c8c67e223.mp4?t=1774462319\" type=\"video/mp4\"></